#: Syncfusion.Server.Reports\Views\Administration\_AuthenticationSettings.cshtml:491
#. @T["Once passed the group or equivalent claim in the authentication token this settings allow automatic user and group mapping based on the received claim value. The claims are normally represented by a JSON object that contains a collection of name and value pairs for each claim. Fill JSON keys with respect to the required details to identify the exact values."]
#: Syncfusion.Server.Reports\Views\Administration\_AuthenticationSettings.cshtml:837
#. @T["Once passed the group or equivalent claim in the authentication token this settings allow automatic user and group mapping based on the received claim value. The claims are normally represented by a JSON object that contains a collection of name and value pairs for each claim. Fill JSON keys with respect to the required details to identify the exact values."]
msgid "Once passed the group or equivalent claim in the authentication token this settings allow automatic user and group mapping based on the received claim value. The claims are normally represented by a JSON object that contains a collection of name and value pairs for each claim. Fill JSON keys with respect to the required details to identify the exact values."
msgstr "Une fois la revendication de groupe ou équivalente passée dans le jeton d’authentification, ces paramètres permettent un mappage automatique utilisateur et groupe en fonction de la valeur de la revendication reçue. Les revendications sont normalement représentées par un objet JSON contenant une collection de paires noms et valeurs pour chaque revendication. Remplissez les clés JSON en fonction des détails requis pour identifier les valeurs exactes."

